      "message": "[Gerrit AI Review] A previous review comment pointed out that if `fw_size_override` exceeds the actual file size, `infile.read()` will fail. There is still no check to prevent reading past the end of the file. Please add a bounds check to ensure `fw_size_override` does not exceed `fw_size`.",
