      "writtenOn": "2026-05-08T21:23:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The code is currently cluttered with `std::cout`, `std::hex`, `std::dec`, `std::setw`, and `std::setfill`. C++23\u0027s `std::print` (built on C++20\u0027s `std::format`) eliminates all of this boilerplate and is significantly faster.\n\n**Before:**\n\n```c\nstd::cout \u003c\u003c \"Flash Size : 0x\" \u003c\u003c std::hex \u003c\u003c std::uppercase\n          \u003c\u003c std::setfill(\u00270\u0027) \u003c\u003c std::setw(8) \u003c\u003c fw_size_override \n          \u003c\u003c std::dec \u003c\u003c std::endl;\n\n```\n\n**After (C++23):**\n\n```c\n#include \u003cprint\u003e\n\nstd::print(\"Flash Size : 0x{:08X}\\n\", fw_size_override);\n\n```",
      "range": {
